          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aba omulayi lundi owe siisa khu nibo. Se alekha babunisibwa tawe. Abakhebulila sikila endakaano yewe ne Aburahamu, Isaaka ne Yakobo. Se ebilila babaandu bewe tawe. Akhaba khukhwola luno Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhalekha Isiraeli tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
